; The port of Simplify to Rocq (README.md) is built by its own Makefile.
; No .ml file here is compiled by the compiler's dune build.
; middle_end/flambda2/dune groups modules from its subdirectories. This
; stanza excludes this folder and its subdirectories from that group, so
; their files do not contribute modules to it or cause duplicate-module-
; name errors in it. This does not exclude the folder from dune build @fmt.

(include_subdirs no)
